      "value": "I do suggest submitted your ideas as individual posts, so they can be voted on individually.\n\nI do agree more worlds like that would be nice, but that's not the Developers, that's for us the players to create!\n\nA character creation tool would be nice, something simple for people to start with, but... I think there is alot of work that needs to be made into the ground work of VRchat, such as Props and such, that have been suggested and is planned.  \n\nFor now, we have talented people, and some are willing to be commissioned to make models for others, just gotta find those people... but don't expect quality for cheap.",
