      "value": "@{5a723d14cf73500ce62dbb51|full_name}: Not saying I'm against the idea.  Just \"For now\" we have talented people.  I just am not sure with current infrastructure a concept would work.  Models are made as a whole, so before we can get this nice custom character thing working, we'd first need  an infrastructure that can support it.",
