  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Vrchat is fun as it is but we need more games within the game especially for vr players such as pvp,car racing world and any other games that will make the game more interesting this game modes could be user generated by the community or ones made by the developers.\nAnother thing is charcter creation some players want to create original models for their selves but they don't have the capability or skills to create them using other complex tools.\nCharcter creation can use robot parts,monsters,humans and aliens to create a unique model without difficulty but off course it's ok to use the models in the game but we want to be a bit more creative.",
